  "relations": [
    {
      "name": "Two distinct pointer aliases in CameraLog",
      "proven": "52ec9bf0 gets firmware manager,52ec9bf4 loads manager+8 FwPartition,52ec9c04 stores it to CameraLog+14. Separate52eca820 calls resource basegetter withslot6 and52eca824 stores buffer to CameraLog+4. Initialslot6base50b81100,size1000,nameCameraLog is distinct fromslot2base50b70100.",
      "condition": "Constructor/Create/bind lifecycle and unchanged initial resource table; not all possible alias substitution or corruption."
    },
    {
      "name": "Actual wide-copy writer",
      "proven": "52eca00c signed count<=0 exits. For positive count N,52eca024 writes N u32 source words to [CameraLog+4]+4..+4*N. The word at payload+0 is preserved. Caller5330f9ac/9b0 loads adjustment-manager+8; factory52eaae40/4c installs CameraLog there. Selectedbranch5330fca4..fce4 builds64words onstack andcalls copy at5330fce0.",
      "limitation": "This is slot6 payload record+4, not slot2 partition record+4. Caller switch identification is not a hardware command execution observation."
    },
    {
      "name": "Actual two-location boot1 payload writer",
      "proven": "52eca200 writes marker a55a5aa5 to buffer+108, sums floor((logicalsize-8)/4) little-endian u32 words modulo2^32 in52eca1a8,stores sum atbuffer+10c. Calls52ff5ad0 at52eca244(block1000) and52eca25c(block1800) withsame buffer and rounded transferlength. Both calls occur regardless offirstresult; returns low8(firstresult & secondresult).",
      "condition": "Known normal logicalsize110; source read count is size-8 rounded down. Prior52ff5ad0 binding selects physical eMMC partition1, distinct from FwPartition.byte10 and resource record+4.",
      "limitation": "No new media IO or atomicity/rollback proof. Marker and additive checksum are not cryptographic authentication."
    },
